# Git Workflow

Use the repository main branch as the source of truth.

Never commit secrets.
Never commit .env.
Never commit broker credentials.
Never commit IBKR credentials.
Never commit API keys.

Use feature branches:
- feature/cursor-foundation-v1
- feature/trading-engine-v1
- feature/scanner-v1
- feature/risk-gate-v1
- feature/base44-admin-v1

Before commit:
- run tests
- run lint if configured
- check git diff
- confirm no secrets

Commit messages should be clear and specific.
